        "id": "thm-qft-conformal-external-scalar",
        "kind": "theorem",
        "domain": "mathematics",
        "library": "mathematics",
        "title": "Exact massless scalar on a conformally flat external metric",
        "statement": "Assume AC_omega; on R4 with eta=(-,+,+,+), smooth positive dimensionless Omega, and prescribed g=Omega^2 eta, define P_g=Box_g-R_g/6 and Phi_g(f)=Phi_0(Omega^3 f) for compact tests. Prove the exact scalar curvature and wave intertwining identities, weak operator-valued distribution continuity on D_fin, the conditional massless Fock field equation and positive vacuum state, local commutativity, formal symmetry, and the two-point kernel relative to curved volume. No generic curved-state, renormalized stress-tensor, massive/minimal-coupling, Einstein-equation, or backreaction claim.",
